      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095698399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095701466665
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return an item.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095706599998
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Can I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095708466664
    },
    {
      "text": "Sarah Jenkins. The order number is VF90210.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095714333330
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Sarah. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see your order for the VeloBand Pulse HR Monitor, delivered on December 15th. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095717399996
    },
    {
      "text": "If that's what it says.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095727933329
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. To make sure I understand the situation, what specifically is the issue with the band? Are you experiencing a technical fault, or is it more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095729666662
    },
    {
      "text": "Preference. I just don't want it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095740933328
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. And you're just now getting a chance to call us about it?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095743333328
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, my son had a medical emergency right before his deployment. He needed unexpected surgery, and I was at the hospital with him for weeks. Returning this wasn't exactly top of my list.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095747799994
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I'm very sorry to hear that. I certainly hope he's recovering well. Please allow me one moment to check the return eligibility on your order.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095760466660
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095770333326
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for waiting, Sarah. I've just reviewed our policy, and you're well within the 90-day return window. So, I can absolutely process a full refund for you today.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095771033326
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. I was worried you'd have some complicated new rule. Guess not.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095782366659
    },
    {
      "text": "Not at all. I'm generating a prepaid return label and I've just sent it to the email we have on file. Simply pack the VeloBand back in its box, attach the label, and you can drop it off at your convenience. Once our warehouse receives it, the refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095787166659
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. That's all?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095805233325
    },
    {
      "text": "That's everything. Was there anything else I could assist you with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095806566658
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 89796,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769095811233324
